# Title: Potential Persistence Via Microsoft Office Add-In
# ID: 8e1cb247-6cf6-42fa-b440-3f27d57e9936
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: NVISO
# Date: 2020-05-11
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1137.006
# Description: Detects potential persistence activity via startup add-ins that load when Microsoft Office starts (.wll/.xll are simply .dll fit for Word or Excel).
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((file_name="*\\Microsoft\\Addins\\*" AND (file_name="*.xlam" OR file_name="*.xla" OR file_name="*.ppam")) OR (file_name="*\\Microsoft\\Word\\Startup\\*" AND file_name="*.wll") OR (file_name="*Microsoft\\Excel\\XLSTART\\*" AND file_name="*.xlam") OR (file_name="*\\Microsoft\\Excel\\Startup\\*" AND file_name="*.xll"))
